Note on provenance: the original Python tool (key_pool.py / dashboard.py /
the FastMCP mcp_server.py skeleton / cli.py) was published without a license
declaration or attribution. This repository ships the original code alongside
compatibility fixes, a new MCP tool (`tavily_research_status`), and a
DeepSeek Harness integration example. If you are the original author and
prefer a different license for your contribution, please open an issue and we
will adjust.